---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import FAQ from '../components/FAQ.astro';
import WikiCard from '../components/WikiCard.astro';
import CategoryHub from '../components/v2/templates/CategoryHub.astro';
import { siteImages } from '../data/images';
import { getPageSEO } from '../utils/seo';
const pageSEO = getPageSEO('workers');
const faqItems = [
  { question: 'What does this Worker Hub cover?', answer: 'It organizes the Worker-related concepts and guides currently available in the Wiki.' },
  { question: 'Where is the hiring walkthrough?', answer: 'Open the How to Hire Workers guide for the task-focused walkthrough. This hub remains the system overview.' },
  { question: 'Are Contract details listed here?', answer: 'No. Contract conditions should be read from the current game interface because the Wiki does not yet have sufficient evidence for a fixed contract model.' },
  { question: 'Is Manual Assign fully documented?', answer: 'Not yet. The term remains part of the Worker topic, but its current behavior should be confirmed from the in-game interface.' },
  { question: 'Can Workers replace restaurant upgrades?', answer: 'Workers support restaurant operation, but ingredients, cooking equipment, furniture, and a practical layout still need to be managed separately.' },
];
---
<BaseLayout pageId="workers" breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: pageSEO.h1 }]}>
  <CategoryHub title={pageSEO.h1} kicker="Staff guide" intro="Learn how Workers fit into restaurant management and find guides for hiring and organizing your service flow." relatedLinks={[{ label: 'How to Hire Workers', href: '/guides/how-to-hire-workers/', description: 'Follow the hiring decision and contract-review process.' }, { label: 'Co-op Guide', href: '/guides/co-op-guide/', description: 'Compare Worker support with active player coordination.' }, { label: 'Upgrade Priority Guide', href: '/guides/upgrade-priority/', description: 'Decide whether staffing matches the restaurant area that needs attention.' }, { label: 'Beginner Guide', href: '/guides/beginner-guide/', description: 'Review the complete restaurant service loop.' }]} relatedHeading="Related Guides" tableOfContents heroImage={siteImages.workersHero}>
  <h2 id="introduction">Introduction</h2>
  <p>Workers are a restaurant-management topic in Karinderya. This hub separates the system overview from the task-focused hiring guide and avoids treating interface labels as fixed rules.</p>

  <h2 id="how-the-worker-system-works">How the Worker System Works</h2>
  <p>The Worker system belongs to restaurant staffing and task management. The exact choices available to a player should be read from the current game interface rather than inferred from older descriptions.</p>
  <p>Use the <a href="/guides/how-to-hire-workers/">How to Hire Workers guide</a> for the hiring task. The Equipment, Ingredients, and Furniture hubs cover the separate systems that shape the restaurant workflow.</p>

  <h2 id="featured-content">Featured Content</h2>
  <div class="card-grid">
    <WikiCard title="How to Hire Workers" description="Review a Worker offer and prepare the restaurant before making a hiring decision." href="/guides/how-to-hire-workers/" icon="H" />
    <WikiCard title="Co-op Guide" description="Organize active players around customer, cooking, and serving tasks." href="/guides/co-op-guide/" icon="C" />
    <WikiCard title="Upgrade Priority" description="Compare staffing with ingredient, equipment, furniture, and layout needs." href="/guides/upgrade-priority/" icon="U" />
  </div>

  <h2 id="contracts">Contracts</h2>
  <p>Contract is a Worker-related interface concept. The Wiki does not currently publish fixed contract durations, costs, Worker types, or benefits.</p>
  <p>Read the complete current interface before making a decision. This hub records where the concept belongs without turning unconfirmed offer details into permanent Wiki rules.</p>

  <h2 id="manual-assign">Manual Assign</h2>
  <p>Manual Assign is a Worker-related label that still needs current gameplay confirmation. The Wiki therefore does not state which tasks, customers, or controls it affects.</p>
  <p>Use the explanation shown by the current interface as the authority for the option available in your session.</p>

  <h2 id="worker-directory">Worker Directory</h2>
  <p>Use this directory to move between the main Worker topics and the guides that explain them in more detail.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="#how-the-worker-system-works">Worker System</a> — understand how Worker support fits into restaurant operation.</li>
    <li><a href="#contracts">Contracts</a> — learn what to review when considering a Worker offer.</li>
    <li><a href="#manual-assign">Manual Assign</a> — understand how assignment choices relate to player control.</li>
    <li><a href="/guides/how-to-hire-workers/">Hiring Guide</a> — follow the complete preparation and hiring process.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="gameplay-tips">Gameplay Tips</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Identify the restaurant task that needs support before opening the hiring interface.</li>
    <li>Read the full Worker offer and any assignment instructions before confirming a choice.</li>
    <li>Keep ingredients, cooking equipment, furniture, and movement paths organized alongside Worker planning.</li>
    <li>After making a change, watch the complete service flow and adjust how you divide tasks.</li>
    <li>Use the hiring guide for step-by-step help and return to this directory for related Worker topics.</li>
  </ul>

  <FAQ items={faqItems} />
  </CategoryHub>
</BaseLayout>
